# P2 swept 0 -> 255 under a ringing explosion and repeated lasers: clean, chip, 3-bit, sample-and-hold, metallic noise.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.5
track kick
param p1 128 0
param p2 0 0
sweep p2 0 255 0 28
note 0 Eb5 4 127
note 8 Eb5 4 127
note 16 Eb5 4 127
note 24 Eb5 4 127
track snare
param p1 128 0
param p2 0 0
sweep p2 0 255 0 28
note 2 Db5 1 110
note 6 Db5 1 110
note 10 Db5 1 110
note 14 Db5 1 110
note 18 Db5 1 110
note 22 Db5 1 110
note 26 Db5 1 110
note 30 Db5 1 110
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 48
expect peak_below -6
